      <aside class="note" aria-hidden="true"><span>Profile</span></aside>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>About <span class="h2km" lang="km">អំពីខ្ញុំ</span></h2>
        <p>
          I&rsquo;m a full-stack developer in Phnom Penh shipping production systems for
          Cambodia&rsquo;s distribution industry: a sales-force app that reps use on the road
          without signal, and the Laravel platform that approves, syncs, and reports those orders.        </p>
        <p>
          Currently at DaunPenh Data Center. Before that, web development at QL Management and an
          internship at NPIC. I care about clean UIs, honest APIs, and apps that keep working offline.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

